From 1e25ab704ff8b3d2c19533e28d934b71dc0e36fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (via Tron)" <tron@tsmconsultz.dev>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 23:32:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix insurance-war-room.html: restore two missing opening
 <script> tags
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Two large JS blocks were unwrapped due to the systemic injector bug
(missing opening <script>, orphaned closing tag downstream):
- 'CORE WAR ROOM LOGIC' block (doc relay, engine dispatch, tour engine,
  speech control) — lines 647-1545, was not executing at all
- INS_TOUR_STEPS block (insTourOpen/insTourClose/insTourNav) —
  was not executing at all, meaning the tour button was dead

Also promoted three script tags (tsm-autorun-engine.js,
tsm-assistant-widget.js, tsm-runtime.js) that were trapped inside a
dead HTML comment containing stray patch instructions instead of
being live tags.

Verified: <script>/</script> count now balanced (23/23), no negative
depth at any point in the file, all 5 inline script blocks pass
'node --check', <body>/<html> singular.

Separately flagged (not fixed here, needs its own commit): both
tsm-mission-guide.js script tags in this file (line 1717 and 2438)
point to a file that does not exist anywhere in the repo.

Also flagged: this same missing-opening-script-tag pattern was found
via repo-wide scan in 15 other war-room/strategist/exec-portal files —
tracked as a follow-up.
---
 html/war-rooms/insure-war/insurance-war-room.html | 11 ++++-------
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/html/war-rooms/insure-war/insurance-war-room.html b/html/war-rooms/insure-war/insurance-war-room.html
index 695ace16..40c0e423 100644
--- a/html/war-rooms/insure-war/insurance-war-room.html
+++ b/html/war-rooms/insure-war/insurance-war-room.html
@@ -644,6 +644,7 @@ body::before{content:'';position:fixed;top:0;right:0;width:600px;height:600px;ba
   <span>TOKENS: <span id="sbTokens" style="color:var(--gold)">0</span> / <span id="sbCost" style="color:var(--green)">$0.0000</span></span>
 </div>
 
+<script>
 /* ════════════════════════════════════════
    CORE WAR ROOM LOGIC (unchanged)
 ════════════════════════════════════════ */
@@ -1660,6 +1661,7 @@ endTour = function(){ speechStop(); _etOrig(); };
 .manifest-close-btn:hover{background:#ef4444;color:#000}
 </style>
 
+<script>
 const INS_TOUR_STEPS = [
   { title: 'INSURANCE WAR ROOM', body: 'This is the Insurance Operations command center. The AI pipeline processes claims documents, EOBs, policy filings, and compliance notices — delivering coverage analysis, financial impact, and a full recovery strategy.' },
   { title: 'E1 · DOCUMENT INTEL', body: 'Extracts structured data: policy numbers, claim IDs, denial codes, coverage types, carrier info, and key dates. Feeds all downstream engines.' },
@@ -1709,15 +1711,9 @@ window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
 window.insTourOpen = insTourOpen;
 window.insHowtoOpen = () => document.getElementById('insHowtoOverlay').classList.add('active');
 </script>
